                "description": "When this power is successfully cast, the Psyker gains an 4+ Invulnerable Save. In addition, the Psyker gains the Shred special rule on all ‘Flamer’, ‘Melta’ and ‘Plasma’ weapons they are equipped with. This effects the Molten Beam Psychic Weapon. The effects of this Psychic Power lasts until the start of your next Shooting Phase.",
